-- SPE1 with one producer in each of eight groups, to show how GCONPROD's
-- procedure on exceeding a limit is recorded for each group.  The limits
-- are far above what the wells can produce, so no procedure is applied.
--   G_NONE, G_CON, G_PCON, G_WELL, G_PLUG, G_RATE : no target, a liquid
--       limit and the procedure NONE, CON, +CON, WELL, PLUG or RATE
--   G_MIX  : no target, oil, water, gas and liquid limits, CON for oil
--            (item 7), +CON for water, PLUG for gas and WELL for liquid
--            (items 11-13)
--   G_ORAT : oil rate target with the procedure CON
-- A restart file is written at every report step.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUNSPEC
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

TITLE
   SPE1 - GROUP PROCEDURES ON EXCEEDING A PRODUCTION LIMIT

DIMENS
   10 10 3 /

EQLDIMS
/

TABDIMS
/

OIL
GAS
WATER
DISGAS

FIELD

START
   1 'JAN' 2015 /

WELLDIMS
-- Max wells, max connections per well, max groups, max wells per group
   10 3 10 10 /

VFPPDIMS
-- Max rates, THPs, WFRs, GFRs, ALQs, tables
   3 3 2 2 1 1 /

UNIFIN
UNIFOUT

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
